# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# ABA relay — NEVER COMMIT THESE
#
# After they are filled in, the launcher scripts contain the real
# ABA_INGEST_SECRET and Telegram API credentials, and a .session file is a
# COMPLETE LOGIN to the Telegram account that created it. Pushing any of
# them to GitHub hands a stranger the ability to grant themselves VIP, or
# to log in as that Telegram account.
#
# The templates are tracked (see tools/*.template if you make one); the
# filled-in copies live only on the machine that runs the relay.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
tools/run-relay.bat
tools/run-relay.sh
tools/aba-relay.service
*.session
*.session-journal
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Telegram video downloader — NEVER COMMIT THESE
#
# run-download.bat / .sh hold the Telegram api_hash and the S3 keys once
# they are filled in, config.json holds the api_hash, and the .session
# file is a COMPLETE LOGIN to that Telegram account. Only the *.template
# copies belong in git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
tools/tg-video-downloader/run-download.bat
tools/tg-video-downloader/run-download.sh
tools/tg-video-downloader/config.json
tools/tg-video-downloader/_tmp/
tools/tg-video-downloader/_state/
tools/tg-video-downloader/downloads/
tools/tg-video-downloader/uploaded_urls.csv
